any astrology which, like Ficino's in De vita, treats particular stars as causes
or influences, deriding genethlialogy with its cardines, dignities, aspects, and
attribution of malice to certain planets, and acknowledging only cumulative
sidereal forces contributing to and signifying large-scale, not personal, events.'
